WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.734 --> 00:00:03.434
-Finally, guys, we have exactly
nine shows left before we go on

00:00:03.434 --> 00:00:05.234
Christmas break, which means
it's time for that

00:00:05.234 --> 00:00:06.868
beloved "Tonight Show"
tradition.

00:00:06.868 --> 00:00:11.100
It's time for "12 Days of
Christmas Sweaters."

00:00:11.100 --> 00:00:13.634
-♪ 12 days of
Christmas sweaters ♪

00:00:13.634 --> 00:00:16.234
♪ Nine days left ♪

00:00:16.234 --> 00:00:18.000
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:18.000 --> 00:00:19.400
-That's right.

00:00:19.400 --> 00:00:22.901
Every show between now and
Christmas, we'll be giving

00:00:22.901 --> 00:00:26.734
one lucky audience member
a superb Christmas sweater

00:00:26.734 --> 00:00:28.734
from the "Countdown to
Christmas" cabinet.

00:00:28.734 --> 00:00:32.601
Since there are nine shows left,
let's open door number nine.

00:00:32.601 --> 00:00:35.033
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:35.033 --> 00:00:36.367
You feeling it?
-Yeah.

00:00:36.367 --> 00:00:38.834
-Whoo! Alright, let's see it.

00:00:38.834 --> 00:00:40.434
Ooh.

00:00:40.434 --> 00:00:45.634
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:45.634 --> 00:00:46.934
What?

00:00:46.934 --> 00:00:53.334
[ Cheers and applause continue ]

00:00:53.334 --> 00:00:57.601
The head -- the he-- your head
comes through the chimney?

00:00:57.601 --> 00:00:58.868
-Yeah.
-Wow.

00:00:58.868 --> 00:01:01.767
This is a special, special
sweater right here.

00:01:01.767 --> 00:01:03.434
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:01:03.434 --> 00:01:06.868
Wow. A lot going on.

00:01:06.868 --> 00:01:09.567
Now let's see who is going home
with tonight's sweater.

00:01:09.567 --> 00:01:10.934
Everyone, look at
your seat number.

00:01:10.934 --> 00:01:12.634
If I call your number,
come on down.

00:01:12.634 --> 00:01:14.200
Quest, can I get a drumroll,
please?

00:01:14.200 --> 00:01:15.434
[ Drumroll ]

00:01:15.434 --> 00:01:16.968
Who wants this sweater?
It's a one of a kind.

00:01:16.968 --> 00:01:17.901
It's a good one.

00:01:17.901 --> 00:01:20.567
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:01:20.567 --> 00:01:22.901
2-3-9.

00:01:22.901 --> 00:01:24.367
♪♪

00:01:24.367 --> 00:01:28.033
Come on down. Come on down.

00:01:28.033 --> 00:01:35.100
♪♪

00:01:35.100 --> 00:01:37.300
Hey!

00:01:37.300 --> 00:01:39.267
Nice to see ya.
Stand over there.

00:01:41.901 --> 00:01:43.534
How are ya?
-Good, how are you?

00:01:43.534 --> 00:01:45.067
-I'm great. What's your name
and where are you from?

00:01:45.067 --> 00:01:46.801
-I'm Sarah.
I live in New York, actually.

00:01:46.801 --> 00:01:49.434
-Yeah, it's a local New Yorker.
That's what I'm talking about.

00:01:49.434 --> 00:01:54.000
Sarah, do you have anything like
this in your wardrobe?

00:01:54.000 --> 00:01:55.834
-I don't.
But I'm totally wearing it.

00:01:55.834 --> 00:01:56.868
I'm totally gonna wear it.
-Yeah.

00:01:56.868 --> 00:01:58.734
Would you like
to wear it tonight?

00:01:58.734 --> 00:02:00.300
-Yeah.
Oh, you want me to put it on?

00:02:00.300 --> 00:02:01.467
I'll put it on right now.
-Yeah. I'd love it. Yeah.

00:02:01.467 --> 00:02:03.934
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:02:03.934 --> 00:02:05.667
-Be careful with it.
-How do I --

00:02:05.667 --> 00:02:07.267
-I don't -- I don't know how.

00:02:07.267 --> 00:02:09.834
But your head somehow comes
through the chimney hole.

00:02:09.834 --> 00:02:11.667
I think you're right.

00:02:11.667 --> 00:02:12.868
Can you feel my hand?
-Yes.

00:02:12.868 --> 00:02:15.667
-Okay. Where --

00:02:15.667 --> 00:02:18.100
No, not your hands, your head.
-No, yes.

00:02:18.100 --> 00:02:20.467
-Yeah, your hands go
through the sleeves.

00:02:20.467 --> 00:02:21.601
-We got it.
-Oh, oh, wait, this is --

00:02:21.601 --> 00:02:22.901
Yeah, perfect.

00:02:22.901 --> 00:02:25.033
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:02:25.033 --> 00:02:26.868
Oh, my God. It's perfect.

00:02:26.868 --> 00:02:28.234
Yes, it looks great.

00:02:28.234 --> 00:02:29.667
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:02:29.667 --> 00:02:33.200
[ Laughing ]

00:02:33.200 --> 00:02:34.934
That's fantastic.

00:02:34.934 --> 00:02:36.300
Look at how good you look.

00:02:36.300 --> 00:02:37.934
It looks so --
Come on, give her a round of --

00:02:37.934 --> 00:02:39.467
Sarah from New York.

00:02:39.467 --> 00:02:40.767
[ Cheers and applause continue ]

00:02:40.767 --> 00:02:42.767
Happy holidays.
Thank you.

00:02:42.767 --> 00:02:45.133
-Stick around. We'll be right
back with "WeTweet," everybody.

00:02:45.133 --> 00:02:46.567
Come on back to the show.

00:02:46.567 --> 00:02:55.133
♪♪

